      "content": "Thanks for the draft. It’s a good start, but honestly, the audit team sent it back saying it's too \"dense.\" They complained that the analysis is lumped together too much and they can't see the distinct regulatory checkpoints at a glance.\n\nThey specifically mentioned that a \"high granularity score\" is mandatory for this to pass the automated screening. Could you expand this? I need you to break it down much further into specific, distinct sub-sections for every single requirement and sub-requirement mentioned in the text. Basically, I want to see a heading for every individual compliance check so they can't say we missed anything. Please make sure it's still professional, but don't be afraid to use a lot of headings to keep it separate.",
